### Drafting a proposal.
###
### Run auth.http first and paste tourpro's token below. Requires ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
### to be set in the server's environment; without it this returns a 400 saying so,
### which is the correct behaviour rather than a failure.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-tourpro-token-here

### The queue, to pick a pending request id.
GET {{host}}/api/host/request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Draft a proposal for one of them. Writes nothing.
POST {{host}}/api/host/request/1/proposal/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A request at a place with no booking history: expect a 400 explaining why,
### not an invented golf course.
POST {{host}}/api/host/request/59/proposal/draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### As a client rather than a host: 403 from SecurityConfig before it reaches anything.
POST {{host}}/api/host/request/1/proposal/draft
Authorization: Bearer paste-a-client-token-here
